card.statement:
The set of ordered monomials

\begin{equation}
F^rK_\lambda E^k := F_{\be_1}^{r_1}\cdots F_{\be_M}^{r_M} \cdot K_1^{\la_1}\cdots K_N^{\la_N}\cdot E_{\be_1}^{k_1}\cdots E_{\be_M}^{k_M}
\end{equation}

where $r,k\in\Z_{\ge 0}^M$ and $\la\in \Z^N$,
form a basis for $U_q(\mathfrak{gl}_N)$.
